node_modules

# Working/scratch backups kept locally per project convention (never
# delete without approval) -- these must never be committed, since some
# have held privacy-sensitive raw footage (e.g. an exposed Game Center
# username toast) before being superseded. Any "_to_delete" folder
# anywhere in the tree is excluded, not just this one path, so the same
# convention stays safe if reused elsewhere on the site.
**/_to_delete/

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Side-by-side backups taken before an edit (script.js.bak etc.). Same
# reasoning as _to_delete/ above: kept locally, never committed.
*.bak
